  "question": {
    "text": "The number and type of bonds between two carbon atoms in <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> are:"
