  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "The structure of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> is <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>≡</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math> so it has one sigma and 2 pi bonds.<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0044_3636a549dade.png\" style=\"width: 140px; height: 197px;\" />"
  }
